MID_LGV_1_Dagsion_Arranger_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1_Dagsion_Arranger_m01_001: Good timing. A duel challenge from a dread warrior\njust arrived with your name on it.
MID_LGA_1_Dagsion_Arranger_m01: <BLN>There's a duel challenge for you.
MID_LGV_1_Dagsion_Arranger_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_1_Dagsion_Arranger_m02_001: May the souls of the bloodthirsty be satisfied\nby dueling.
MID_LGV_1_Dagsion_Arranger_m03: <TH>
MID_LGV_1_Dagsion_Arranger_m03_001: I bet your opponent's been counting the seconds\nwaiting for you to show up. Enjoy your duel.
MID_LGA_1_Dagsion_Arranger_m03: <BLN>Enjoy your duel.
MID_LGV_1_Dagsion_Arranger_m04: <TH>
MID_LGV_1_Dagsion_Arranger_m04_001: So you took down a dread warrior and lived to\ntell the tale. Now you need to report your win!
MID_LGA_1_Dagsion_Arranger_m04: <BLN>You took them down!
MID_LGV_1_Dagsion_Arranger_m05: <TH>
MID_LGV_1_Dagsion_Arranger_m05_001: Nice work! I knew you were the right man for the\njob, so I'm glad I took the time to talk to you.
MID_LGV_1_Dagsion_Arranger_m05_002: Duel challenges will keep on coming. Don't be\na stranger.
MID_LGV_1_Dagsion_Arranger_m06: <TH>
MID_LGV_1_Dagsion_Arranger_m06_001: There are no duel challenges for you at the moment.\nCheck back later after gaining some renown.
MID_LGA_1_Dagsion_Arranger_m06: <BLN>No duel challenges for you today.
MID_LGV_1_Dagsion_Arranger_m07: <TH>
MID_LGV_1_Dagsion_Arranger_m07_001: Seems you've received your last challenge. What do\nyou mean, why? Are you kidding me?
MID_LGV_1_Dagsion_Arranger_m07_002: Because you've taken care of all of them already, you\nbloodthirsty fool!
MID_LGV_1_Dagsion_Arranger_m07_003: You've put me out of a job, in fact. But we may meet\nagain someday, if the gods are willing.
MID_LGV_1LED_Dagsion_Showman01_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1LED_Dagsion_Showman01_m01_001: Sounds like lots of people want to watch you dance!\nHead out to perform and fulfill their requests.
MID_LGA_1LED_Dagsion_Showman01_m01: <BLN>New performance requests!
MID_LGV_1LED_Dagsion_Showman01_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_1LED_Dagsion_Showman01_m02_001: I'm going to host an event at my tavern soon.\nWould you be so kind as to help?
MID_LGA_1LED_Dagsion_Showman01_m02: <BLN>Think you can help?
MID_LGV_1LED_Dagsion_Showman01_m03: <TH>
MID_LGV_1LED_Dagsion_Showman01_m03_001: All ready for the event? Great! Everything's set.
MID_LGV_1LED_Dagsion_Showman01_m03_002: Well, everything except you being on stage. C'mon!\nGive us a show!
MID_LGV_1LED_Dagsion_Showman01_m04: <TH>
MID_LGV_1LED_Dagsion_Showman01_m04_001: No matter how many times I see you dance, the\namazement never wears off. That was incredible!
MID_LGV_1LED_Dagsion_Showman01_m05: <TH>
MID_LGV_1LED_Dagsion_Showman01_m05_001: I'm gonna follow your lead—you're the best dancer,\nso I'll become the best tavern keeper!
MID_LGV_1LED_Dagsion_Showman01_m06: <TH>
MID_LGV_1LED_Dagsion_Showman01_m06_001: This has been great, but I think I've taken advantage\nof your kindness long enough. Thank you so much!
MID_LGA_1LED_Dagsion_Showman01_m06: <BLN>It's been great!
MID_LGV_3LED_Dagsion_Showman01_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_3LED_Dagsion_Showman01_m01_001: Leda, you're alive! Thank the gods!
MID_LGV_3LED_Dagsion_Showman01_m01_002: I'll spare you all the details, but I've been lucky\nenough to survive.
MID_LGV_3LED_Dagsion_Showman01_m01_003: At one point, I was planning to shut this place down.\nI don't feel that way anymore.
MID_LGV_3LED_Dagsion_Showman01_m01_004: Now more than ever, I think folks need a place to\ngather, drink, and watch a good show.
MID_LGV_3LED_Dagsion_Showman01_m01_005: Which is where you come in! Would the graceful\nLeda return to the stage to lift people's hearts?
MID_LGA_3LED_Dagsion_Showman01_m01: <BLN>You're alive!
MID_LGV_3LED_Dagsion_Showman01_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_3LED_Dagsion_Showman01_m02_001: Would the graceful Leda return to the stage?\nInspire the people, and give them hope?
MID_LGA_3LED_Dagsion_Showman01_m02: <BLN>Please, would you?
MID_LGV_3LED_Dagsion_Showman01_m03: <TH>
MID_LGV_3LED_Dagsion_Showman01_m03_001: You danced for them, hm? I'm sure that really\ncheered them up.
MID_LGV_3LED_Dagsion_Showman01_m03_002: I, too, would like to bear witness to your divine\nmovements! Please, would you honor me?
MID_LGV_3LED_Dagsion_Showman01_m04: <TH>
MID_LGV_3LED_Dagsion_Showman01_m04_001: As wonderful as ever—no, even more spectacular\nthan before! Somehow, you've gotten better!
MID_LGV_3LED_Dagsion_Showman01_m04_002: Seeing you dance, I feel a deep sense of hope...\nWould you visit a few last places for me?
MID_LGV_3LED_Dagsion_Showman01_m05: <TH>
MID_LGV_3LED_Dagsion_Showman01_m05_001: You've done all that I asked, and now I assume you\nintend to return to the fight.
MID_LGV_3LED_Dagsion_Showman01_m05_002: Bear this in mind: Your art has lifted up so many\npeople. In that way, you're a savior too.
MID_LGA_3LED_Dagsion_Showman01_m05: <BLN>Thank you for everything.
