MID_LGV_X_TempleCmn_Audience01_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_X_TempleCmn_Audience01_m01_001: Not just anyone can get an audience with a god.\nThe temples have standards.
MID_LGV_X_TempleCmn_Audience01_m01_002: Only those who have made names for themselves are\nallowed in. You are not one of them.
MID_LGA_X_TempleCmn_Audience01_m01: <BLN>Do you desire an audience?
MID_LGV_X_TempleCmn_Audience01_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_X_TempleCmn_Audience01_m02_001: It is possible to have audiences with divines at their\ntemples. And it is considered a great honor.
MID_LGV_X_TempleCmn_Audience01_m02_002: This opportunity is not available to everyone.\nYou must have made a name for yourself first.
MID_LGV_X_TempleCmn_Audience01_m02_003: Do you desire an audience with the divine? If so,\nI shall grant you permission to meet. 
MID_LGV_X_TempleCmn_Audience01_m02_004: <ICA>Accept.
MID_LGV_X_TempleCmn_Audience01_m02_005: <ICB>Decline.
MID_LGA_X_TempleCmn_Audience01_m02: <BLN>Do you desire an audience?
MID_LGV_X_TempleCmn_Audience01_m03: <TH>
MID_LGV_X_TempleCmn_Audience01_m03_001: Your audience with the divine has concluded.\nYou are not granted further contact.
MID_LGA_X_TempleCmn_Audience01_m03: <BLN>Your audience has concluded.